# Requirement 1.6:
#
#   Access to an emulated info page through host_tl is always blocked
#
# Here, "blocked" means that the D-channel response to the A-channel transaction will have d_error=1
# and there will be junk data in d_data.
#
#  - The "host_tl_snapshot_rsp_now" signal (defined in tb.sv) tracks the fact that we are seeing a
#    D-channel response on host_tl.
#
#  - If host_tl_req_snapshot_in_info_region is true then the snapshotted A-channel transaction is
#    reading an address in an emulated info region.
#
#  - If so, the D-channel response should have d_error=1.
lemma req_1_6
  ErrorOnHostInfoRead: have (host_tl_snapshot_rsp_now &&
                             host_tl_req_snapshot_in_info_region
                             |->
                             host_tl_o.d_error)
